"textMapHash":1926423954,"text":"Traveler, what a pleasant surprise.","nextNodeIds":[705080103]},{"nodeId":705080103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3407349570,"text":"What are you two doing here?","nextNodeIds":[705080104]},{"nodeId":705080104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":439609082,"text":"Wait, did you two come together?","nextNodeIds":[705080105]},{"nodeId":705080105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":2503579674,"text":"This lady decided on a whim that she wanted a little vacation, so we ended up traveling around the area.","nextNodeIds":[705080106]},{"nodeId":705080106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":1981104962,"text":"But I guess we have different ideas of vacation. We hardly hiked the mountains before we came here to put our feet up. Talk about spoiled.","nextNodeIds":[705080107]},{"nodeId":705080107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":1008850842,"text":"Come now, no need to hurt anyone's feelings. Besides, I specifically chose this place because I knew how much you like to drink.","nextNodeIds":[705080108]},{"nodeId":705080108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":2424980730,"text":"But our captain here has seen a lot more of the world, so she's not exactly thrilled with this little tavern.","nextNodeIds":[705080109]},{"nodeId":705080109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":1042677554,"text":"It'll do. Anyway, this one's on me, okay?","nextNodeIds":[705080110]},{"nodeId":705080110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3103991354,"text":"Beidou's paying? Uh, does that include us?","nextNodeIds":[705080111]},{"nodeId":705080111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerNa