"Beidou","textMapHash":2503579674,"text":"This lady decided on a whim that she wanted a little vacation, so we ended up traveling around the area.","nextNodeIds":[705080106]},{"nodeId":705080106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":1981104962,"text":"But I guess we have different ideas of vacation. We hardly hiked the mountains before we came here to put our feet up. Talk about spoiled.","nextNodeIds":[705080107]},{"nodeId":705080107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":1008850842,"text":"Come now, no need to hurt anyone's feelings. Besides, I specifically chose this place because I knew how much you like to drink.","nextNodeIds":[705080108]},{"nodeId":705080108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":2424980730,"text":"But our captain here has seen a lot more of the world, so she's not exactly thrilled with this little tavern.","nextNodeIds":[705080109]},{"nodeId":705080109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":1042677554,"text":"It'll do. Anyway, this one's on me, okay?","nextNodeIds":[705080110]},{"nodeId":705080110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3103991354,"text":"Beidou's paying? Uh, does that include us?","nextNodeIds":[705080111]},{"nodeId":705080111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1179734522,"text":"We're the bartenders, Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[705080112]},{"nodeId":705080112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1335799506,"text":"Oh right. Hehe, sorry... guess that's just a habit now.","nextNodeIds":[705080113]},{"nodeId":705080113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2674558714,"text":"And what can I get for the two lovely ladies?","nextNodeIds":[705080114]},{"nodeId":705080114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":2095075618,"text":"I'll have a small Birch Sap, on the sour side.","nextNodeIds":[705080115]},{"nodeId":705080115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":910140818,"text":"Uh... I will have a... a large Dusk, please. Thanks!","nextNodeIds":[705080116]},{"nodeId":705080116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3902197834,"text":"Got it. Coming right up.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050803,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050803,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_NOT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1068,40],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q7050204_Play"}],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1031"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1068,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7050804,"order":6,"stepDescription":"Give the drinks to Ningguang and Beidou","stepDescTextMapHash":3307031028,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1031"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1068,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7050802],"talks":[{"talkId":7050802,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7050804","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7050802,"initDialog":705080201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[10211,1031],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Mengde_70508/Q7050802","priority":5,"questId":70508,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":705080201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":3656837426,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[705080202]},{"nodeId":705080202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":2672905042,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[705080203]},{"nodeId":705080203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2451391794,"text":"Well? H—How is it? This silence is making Paimon nervous!","nextNodeIds":[705080204]},{"nodeId":705080204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":2646924946,"text":"Mmm... The bittersweet taste of nostalgia.","nextNodeIds":[705080205]},{"nodeId":705080205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":4286114810,"text":"You mean the taste of going from rags to riches? Just what kind of taste is that?","nextNodeIds":[705080206]},{"nodeId":705080206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":3120149690,"text":"Hehe... It's mainly sour with just a tinge of sweetness, and a lingering aftertaste.","nextNodeIds":[705080207]},{"nodeId":705080207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":215259306,"text":"Interesting... Does it taste like starting a little business then discovering that selling fruit isn't very lucrative?","nextNodeIds":[705080208]},{"nodeId":705080208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":3285643282,"text":"No need to get into the details. Let's leave the past in the past.","nextNodeIds":[705080209]},{"nodeId":705080209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":815682554,"text":"Haha, who'd have thought that the dignified Tianquan was once a fruit vendor on the street.","nextNodeIds":[705080210]},{"nodeId":705080210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":3313484546,"text":"On the other hand, I bet few can tell that I'm from an ordinary fishing village, right?","nextNodeIds":[705080211]},{"nodeId":705080211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":1686849786,"text":"Not necessarily. If you ask me...","nextNodeIds":[705080212]},{"nodeId":705080212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":2466287370,"text":"I'd say that Captain Beidou has eyes that can pierce the sea. You're an adventure-seeking pioneer who tames the wind and the waves... Which is clearly indicative of someone who grew up by the sea.","nextNodeIds":[705080213]},{"nodeId":705080213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":3229438938,"text":"Hey, you're not mocking me, are you?","nextNodeIds":[705080214]},{"nodeId":705080214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":1476815274,"text":"Come now, it wouldn't do any good to be sarcastic.","nextNodeIds":[705080215]},{"nodeId":705080215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":608086066,"text":"I know how fierce you can be with words. It's my treat today, so remember to take it easy on me.","nextNodeIds":[705080216]},{"nodeId":705080216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":690811498,"text":"Alright, then I'd like to have a few more.","nextNodeIds":[705080217,705080218]},{"nodeId":705080217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2343547650,"text":"Another drink for the lovely lady?","nextNodeIds":[705080219]},{"nodeId":705080218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":91082506,"text":"We're here to serve you!","nextNodeIds":[705080219]},{"nodeId":705080219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1277314330,"text":"Well, you heard the good lady, bartender!","nextNodeIds":[705080220]},{"nodeId":705080220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":2487473194,"text":"I like where this is going! I'll have another round, too!","nextNodeIds":[705080221]},{"nodeId":705080234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Black Screen","textMapHash":2780421026,"text":"You give the two a refill immediately...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705080221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":2062991514,"text":"Mondstadt's fresh fruit juice is hard to top. I wish I could enjoy some every day.","nextNodeIds":[705080222]},{"nodeId":705080222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":3306528010,"text":"Are you serious? Don't tell me you're gonna open a Sunsettia trade route now...","nextNodeIds":[705080223]},{"nodeId":705080223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":2012756514,"text":"Hmm, an interesting proposition.","nextNodeIds":[705080224]},{"nodeId":705080224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":1363223554,"text":"Wait... Huh, really?","nextNodeIds":[705080225]},{"nodeId":705080225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":836282386,"text":"I'm just joking, of course. There's already a whole industry established for that. They don't need me muscling my way in to their business.","nextNodeIds":[705080226]},{"nodeId":705080226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":4017279634,"text":"#Thanks for the drinks today, {NICKNAME}. If you'd ever like a cushy job, I'd enjoy having you as my personal bartender.","nextNodeIds":[705080227]},{"nodeId":705080227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"Beidou","textMapHash":2066252002,"text":"You're also welcome aboard the Alcor. The crew loves to drink, you could come feast with us. I promise you'd have a blast.","nextNodeIds":[705080228]},{"nodeId":705080228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"Ningguang","textMapHash":1061283426,"text":"My, my, Captain Beidou, are you competing with me for talent? That's hardly necessary. You may simply stop by the Jade Chamber whenever you want the Traveler to mix you a drink.","nextNodeIds":[705080229]},{"nodeId":705080229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3027398346,"text":"(I'm so popular!)","nextNodeIds":[705080230]},{"nodeId":705080230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":587835450,"text":"Is it Paimon, or does it sound like they think you work for them?","nextNodeIds":[705080231,705080232]},{"nodeId":705080231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2316137530,"text":"When I have a chance...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705080232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":206575154,"text":"I'll visit you both. I promise.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1068,50],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q7050204_Play"}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1068","201068004"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1068","201068005"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1031"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1068,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK"